  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="price_clause">
        <p>Ubertinus de Ugurgieri dat Albertino de Scottis decimas plebis Sanctae Mariae in Spedal cum frumentis vinis et oleis, et accipit in permutatione decimas plebis Sancti Petri in Villore cum omnibus fructibus et proventibus, utraque parte consentiente et laudante.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="penalty_clause">
        <p>Si quis ex partibus hanc permutationem rescindere temptaverit, poenam dupli valoris rerum permutatarum persolvat et carta ista in suo robore permaneat.</p>
      </div>
      <listWitness>
        <witness>
          <name>Guido de Berardenga</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Ildebrandinus filius Petri</name>
        </witness>
        <witness>
          <name>Farinatus de Vecchiettis</name>
        </witness>
      </listWitness>
    </body>
